+space, which is zero only when q = p. The loss below subtracts the
+sampler's expected score, so the per-token score becomes e_x - q, whose
+expectation under q is exactly zero for any mismatch. See REPORT.md.
+
+Importance-sampling corrections (ISCorrection) are still available: each
+is REINFORCE with a detached weight w(r) on the ratio r = p/q.
